  {
    "id": "ST10",
    "title": "威胁点、健康人口与取样下限",
    "statement": "普通玩家基地威胁=(wealthCurve(I+.5B+P)+ΣcolonistCurve(W)*(.35+.65*健康))*地图随机1*适应混合*难度*settlement曲线，再夹GlobalMin至10000。settlement曲线用整数DaysPassedSinceSettle，下限上界用float日数，12日前35，35日达到难度上界，随机seed=ticksGame/2500。非基地、动物、机械体、奴隶、儿童等另有原版分支，本独立算例只覆盖健康输入的自由成年殖民者。",
    "kind": "xml-and-static-derived",
    "sources": [
      {
        "group": "economy",
        "type": "RimWorld.StorytellerUtility",
        "line_start": 14,
        "line_end": 189,
        "range_sha256": "ea613cc1e7283c538484458921b216767ad8bc5cf8aef1d5305538e42a5cd671"
      },
      {
        "group": "economy",
        "type": "Verse.Map",
